1
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:40,479
Your mom made you sit out in the sun again?

2
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,560
Then let me shade you.

3
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:48,039
Thank you, Sister Xiaowei.

4
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:51,719
What kind of

5
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,879
book is this?

6
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,759
It's a book

7
00:02:55,759 --> 00:02:58,360
about women's pursuit of fairness and justice.

8
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,639
Let me share a quote with you.

9
00:03:00,879 --> 00:03:02,000
At all times,

10
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,199
you must have courage,

11
00:03:03,479 --> 00:03:04,960
whether it's to defend yourself,

12
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,360
or to defend a friend.

13
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,639
So right now, Sister Xiaowei

14
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:12,759
is defending me.

15
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,439
You bitch!

16
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,960
How dare you seduce my son!

17
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,280
Have you no shame in broad daylight!

18
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:19,960
I didn't.

19
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,639
Mom!

20
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:21,560
Don't touch Sister Xiaowei!

21
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:22,360
And you!

22
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:24,199
You're nothing but trouble too!

23
00:03:24,199 --> 00:03:24,919
When someone seduces you,

24
00:03:24,919 --> 00:03:25,879
can't you say no?

25
00:03:25,879 --> 00:03:27,120
Mom, it has nothing to do with Dongdong.

26
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:27,879
Mom!

27
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,120
Did you think just because he's a cripple,

28
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,360
you'd be good enough for him?

29
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,759
And you could marry into the Cheng family?

30
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,120
How can you be so shameless?

31
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:33,680
I didn't.

32
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,639
You wish.

33
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,400
In your dreams!

34
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,240
Sister Xiaowei!

35
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,039
You bitch!

36
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,199
Are you okay, Dongdong?

37
00:03:53,319 --> 00:03:54,120
Are you hurt?

38
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,000
It was her.

39
00:03:55,159 --> 00:03:56,759
Sister Sang Luo pushed me into the water!

40
00:03:56,759 --> 00:03:57,400
Mom.

41
00:03:57,439 --> 00:03:58,240
As you know,

42
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,800
Dongdong never lies.

43
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:00,960
It was Sang Luo.

44
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:02,360
Sang Luo tried to kill him!

45
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,080
What is this?

46
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:11,879
You should be familiar with this, Aunt.

47
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,360
Isn't this just from when he

48
00:04:17,439 --> 00:04:19,079
got bruised falling into the water?

49
00:04:19,079 --> 00:04:20,240
This is a sunburn.

50
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,920
It's a mark left from you making him stay

51
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,839
out in the hot sun for four hours every day.

52
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:26,399
It's proof that you, as his mother,

53
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:27,720
to vent your frustrations,

54
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,079
have been abusing him.

55
00:04:29,319 --> 00:04:31,279
How have you been taking care of Dongdong?!

56
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:32,839
I...

57
00:04:32,839 --> 00:04:33,360
Grandmother.

58
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,759
Dongdong already has trouble with his legs.

59
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,040
So,

60
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,600
no matter how Aunt tortures him,

61
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,959
he can only obey.

62
00:04:40,439 --> 00:04:41,360
Even if it hurts

63
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,519
or burns,

64
00:04:43,079 --> 00:04:44,959
he still has to stay out in the sun,

65
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:46,360
not daring to move an inch.

66
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,560
Aunt abuses Dongdong like this every day.

67
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,920
Did you know about this, Grandmother?

68
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:52,839
E-

69
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:54,879
Even if he really does have sunburns,

70
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,600
that still

71
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,680
doesn't prove Sang Luo didn't push him!

72
00:04:59,040 --> 00:04:59,879
Dongdong.

73
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,839
Tell the truth.

74
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:04,199
Did I push you into the water?

75
00:05:05,759 --> 00:05:06,759
I...

76
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:08,680
I...

77
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,040
Enough.

78
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:12,000
Dongdong has limited mobility.

79
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,600
It's normal for him to fall in accidentally.

80
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,600
As for this matter,

81
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,360
let's leave it at that.

82
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,000
Mom!

83
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,360
Shut up!

84
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,240
Mom...

85
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:35,759
You filthy sewer rat.

86
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:38,079
I'll definitely catch you next time.

87
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,879
You're right.

88
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:54,199
I am a sewer rat.

89
00:05:54,519 --> 00:05:56,160
So, Aunt,

90
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,759
you'd better watch your back.

91
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,959
Don't let me catch you.

92
00:06:01,959 --> 00:06:04,319
Otherwise, just like a rat,

93
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:07,360
I'll tear off your flesh, bite by bite.

94
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,079
By the way, Aunt.

95
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,720
Stop what you're doing to Dongdong.

96
00:06:20,639 --> 00:06:21,879
The most pathetic thing about him

97
00:06:21,879 --> 00:06:23,600
isn't his disabled body,

98
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,639
it's having a mother like you.

99
00:06:26,639 --> 00:06:27,519
You...

100
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:28,639
Psycho!

101
00:06:33,639 --> 00:06:35,759
I don't ever want to hear you say that again.

102
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:40,160
At the end of the day,

103
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:42,839
she's still my eldest brother's child.

104
00:06:42,839 --> 00:06:44,959
I won't allow you to bully her like this.

105
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:49,360
My eldest brother is dead.

106
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:53,839
So as for you,

107
00:06:55,319 --> 00:06:58,800
you don't have to follow him like a dog.

108
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:03,600
Sis,

109
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,800
Big brother was the only one kind to me.

110
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,519
If everyone plays nice,

111
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:11,240
we can all live in peace.

112
00:07:11,839 --> 00:07:14,040
But if you insist on causing her trouble,

113
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,360
then I'll bite you to death.

114
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,399
You've lost it!

115
00:07:19,399 --> 00:07:21,600
Are both of you out of your minds?

116
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:23,759
You two are just a pair of psychos, right?

117
00:07:23,759 --> 00:07:25,160
You're all psychos! Just crazy!

118
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:45,160
What happened today...

119
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,120
nobody else saw it, but I did.

120
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:49,879
Dongdong falling into the water...

121
00:07:50,319 --> 00:07:52,199
don't you feel the slightest bit of guilt?

122
00:07:52,199 --> 00:07:55,319
Only people living well can afford guilt.

123
00:07:55,319 --> 00:07:56,920
Why should I feel guilty?

124
00:08:00,319 --> 00:08:01,279
Endure it.

125
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:06,560
I've endured more than enough in the past.

126
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,639
Now, I only swiftly dispose of

127
00:08:07,639 --> 00:08:10,279
anything that has no further value.

128
00:08:14,079 --> 00:08:15,360
And then what?

129
00:08:15,759 --> 00:08:17,480
What are you going to do next?

130
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:27,040
Next,

131
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:29,399
I'm going to change my clothes.

132
00:08:29,399 --> 00:08:31,759
Are you going to stay here, Little Uncle?

133
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:04,320
Look into Sang Luo's past for me.

134
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:05,879
I need every single detail.

135
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,480
As soon as possible.

136
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,080
Do it yourself.

137
00:09:20,559 --> 00:09:21,360
Good morning, Aunt.

138
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,679
Eating so much protein?

139
00:09:30,039 --> 00:09:31,039
Working out?

140
00:09:31,159 --> 00:09:32,039
The doctor said

141
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,200
to eat more high-quality protein.

142
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,120
It's good for the baby.

143
00:09:34,399 --> 00:09:35,639
Baby this, baby that.

144
00:09:35,919 --> 00:09:38,000
Like you're the first one to have a baby.

145
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,159
Back in my day,

146
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,480
I didn't make such a fuss.

147
00:09:45,039 --> 00:09:46,600
Aunt Lin is in great health.

148
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,320
She hasn't had morning sickness even once.

149
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,840
Actually, you don't need to eat this much.

150
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,279
I've had morning sickness too.

151
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,279
It's just that

152
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,120
it's not frequent.

153
00:09:54,799 --> 00:09:56,440
You really are lucky.

154
00:09:56,559 --> 00:09:58,840
Carrying a baby that doesn't cause trouble.

155
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,039
Unlike me.

156
00:10:02,639 --> 00:10:04,120
Why aren't you eating?

157
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:06,720
I'm not hungry.

158
00:10:07,279 --> 00:10:08,320
Then don't eat.

159
00:10:08,399 --> 00:10:09,440
Don't ever eat again.

160
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,440
To earn money for medical bills.

161
00:10:16,559 --> 00:10:18,080
She and her mother lived in the slums.

162
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,399
Her mom set up stalls, did cleaning,

163
00:10:20,399 --> 00:10:21,200
and delivered food.

164
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,080
Since she was little,

165
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,240
she worked right alongside her.

166
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:24,440
As for her fingers...

167
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:25,879
it was after a cleaning shift

168
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:26,879
when she ran into a mugger.

169
00:10:26,919 --> 00:10:27,960
Trying to protect her money,

170
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,279
they were brutally snapped.

171
00:10:33,919 --> 00:10:35,120
Since she's part of the Cheng family,

172
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:37,240
her wanting to take back her share

173
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,320
is completely understandable.

174
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:44,360
But this Sang Luo gives me the feeling she's

175
00:10:45,519 --> 00:10:46,759
hiding something.

176
00:11:07,679 --> 00:11:08,759
What's in the water?

177
00:11:09,799 --> 00:11:10,720
Nothing much.

178
00:11:11,279 --> 00:11:14,279
Just some mulberry to trigger your allergy.

179
00:11:16,279 --> 00:11:17,240
Ye Xiaowei.

180
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,519
I'm warning you.

181
00:11:18,519 --> 00:11:20,080
Stay away from Dongdong.

182
00:11:20,279 --> 00:11:21,559
Or next time,

183
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:23,799
it won't just be an allergic reaction.

184
00:11:26,799 --> 00:11:28,919
The plan against Cheng Ruolin is moved up.

185
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:30,120
Also,

186
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:31,919
I'll be going to Gufeng Group next.

187
00:11:34,399 --> 00:11:36,159
It'll be livelier than the Cheng family.

188
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:41,799
Cheng Ruolin caused you so much trouble,

189
00:11:42,039 --> 00:11:43,559
yet you never considered changing the plan.

190
00:11:45,399 --> 00:11:46,320
What happened now?

191
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,360
Suddenly changed your mind?

192
00:11:50,919 --> 00:11:51,960
For a friend.

193
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,519
You ungrateful wretch!

194
00:11:53,639 --> 00:11:54,679
You didn't help me when it mattered most,

195
00:11:54,679 --> 00:11:55,720
you just kept your mouth shut!

196
00:11:57,559 --> 00:11:58,600
That book Ye Xiaowei left you,

197
00:11:58,919 --> 00:11:59,840
you treat it like a treasure.

198
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:00,879
Don't touch my book!

199
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:06,720
Don't look at me like that!

200
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:12,279
You look exactly like your useless father.

201
00:12:12,919 --> 00:12:15,320
Do you know how he tortured me?

202
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:20,320
You owe me, your whole family owes me!

203
00:12:20,679 --> 00:12:22,000
No...

204
00:12:22,679 --> 00:12:24,320
No!

205
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:28,720
You cripple!

206
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:30,279
You damned cripple!

207
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,480
Stand up!

208
00:12:38,559 --> 00:12:39,519
Do you hear me?!

209
00:12:39,679 --> 00:12:40,360
Stand up!

210
00:12:40,399 --> 00:12:41,080
Stand up!

211
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:41,840
Stand up!

212
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:51,639
Mom,

213
00:12:51,879 --> 00:12:54,120
this is our company's new red wine.

214
00:12:54,279 --> 00:12:55,960
I brought it especially for you.

215
00:12:58,559 --> 00:12:59,360
Luoluo,

216
00:13:00,159 --> 00:13:02,559
try this new product from the company.

217
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:03,639
I heard

218
00:13:03,639 --> 00:13:05,120
the internal reviews are quite good.

219
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,360
Okay, Grandmother.

220
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:20,559
What's in this wine?

221
00:13:20,559 --> 00:13:21,960
Grapes, of course.

222
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,360
But for a better taste,

223
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:24,679
we added some mulberries.

224
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:28,759
What?

225
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:31,240
Never had such good wine before?

226
00:13:33,399 --> 00:13:34,440
This red wine

227
00:13:34,919 --> 00:13:36,120
is rich and mellow,

228
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:38,240
with a playful hint of fruit juice.

229
00:13:38,639 --> 00:13:39,879
Such a novel approach

230
00:13:39,879 --> 00:13:41,480
is a first for me.

231
00:13:41,519 --> 00:13:42,759
So I was a bit surprised.

232
00:13:42,759 --> 00:13:43,480
Luoluo.

233
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,799
Take this wine back and enjoy it.

234
00:13:46,039 --> 00:13:47,240
Taking care of me these past few days,

235
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,080
you've worked hard.

236
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:49,279
Okay, Grandmother.

237
00:13:49,399 --> 00:13:50,159
Mom.

238
00:13:50,639 --> 00:13:52,960
I brought this wine specifically for you.

239
00:13:53,399 --> 00:13:55,000
I appreciate your filial piety.

240
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:57,039
Just say what's on your mind.

241
00:13:57,879 --> 00:13:58,600
Grandmother,

242
00:13:58,639 --> 00:13:59,120
Yes?

243
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:00,600
Aunt came specifically to see you.

244
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:02,000
She must have something to say.

245
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:03,600
I'll head back first.

246
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:07,440
Our Luoluo is so sensible.

247
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,039
Go on, go on.

248
00:14:09,840 --> 00:14:10,399
Mhm.

249
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:17,120
Mom,

250
00:14:17,399 --> 00:14:18,799
how could you, in front of Sang Luo,

251
00:14:18,799 --> 00:14:19,799
say such things about me?

252
00:14:19,879 --> 00:14:21,200
I am the most filial one.

253
00:14:21,519 --> 00:14:23,440
I'm much better than that guy Cheng An.

254
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:24,799
Don't mention him in front of me.

255
00:14:26,799 --> 00:14:27,639
And also,

256
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,879
if you're going to talk to me about money,

257
00:14:30,399 --> 00:14:31,440
save your breath.

258
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:33,720
Mom,

259
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:35,960
don't be like this.

260
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:38,080
Can you please help me?

261
00:14:38,879 --> 00:14:41,440
I just have a tiny deficit to cover.

262
00:14:41,519 --> 00:14:42,799
If you don't help me,

263
00:14:42,799 --> 00:14:44,759
no one else can.

264
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:46,639
You brought this upon yourself,

265
00:14:46,639 --> 00:14:48,480
so go pay it off yourself.

266
00:14:48,639 --> 00:14:49,759
Mom...

267
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:51,399
Mom!

268
00:14:51,399 --> 00:14:52,440
This necklace is nice.

269
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:54,000
I happen to need one like this.

270
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:55,240
Just give it to me.

271
00:14:55,639 --> 00:14:56,440
Thanks, Mom!

272
00:14:56,639 --> 00:14:57,639
You ungrateful child!

273
00:15:00,399 --> 00:15:01,200
What's wrong?

274
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:07,519
What happened to her?

275
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:08,840
Is she okay?

276
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:10,799
She drank some of my mulberry wine.

277
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:12,039
Maybe she had too much.

278
00:15:13,039 --> 00:15:13,759
Cheng An,

279
00:15:13,879 --> 00:15:14,840
have you been

280
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,039
doing well financially

281
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,000
lately?

282
00:15:18,519 --> 00:15:19,279
You...

283
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:42,120
Sang Luo!

284
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:43,000
Open the door!

285
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:44,799
Are you okay?

286
00:15:45,639 --> 00:15:46,440
Sang Luo!

287
00:15:48,039 --> 00:15:49,240
What do you mean?

288
00:15:50,279 --> 00:15:51,240
I'm trying to sleep.

289
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:52,720
Whatever it is, tell me tomorrow.

290
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:54,600
An allergic reaction is serious.

291
00:15:54,759 --> 00:15:55,679
You could die!

292
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:57,000
Open the door!

293
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:59,440
If you don't open it, I'll break it down!

294
00:16:12,559 --> 00:16:13,360
Take it.

295
00:16:13,559 --> 00:16:14,360
Allergy medicine.

296
00:16:14,639 --> 00:16:15,600
Who said I'm allergic?

297
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:24,399
I had a friend allergic to mulberry...

298
00:16:28,879 --> 00:16:30,000
Since you're not allergic,

299
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:31,759
then go to bed early.

300
00:16:48,039 --> 00:16:49,440
Where's the money and jewelry?

301
00:16:49,759 --> 00:16:51,039
It was here a minute ago.

302
00:16:51,159 --> 00:16:52,159
Where did it go?

303
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,960
I put away the jewelry and cards.

304
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:05,480
You come from a prestigious family.

305
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:09,000
If word gets out that you like to steal...

306
00:17:09,039 --> 00:17:10,759
What do you mean by steal?

307
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,400
Everything you're wearing...

308
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:13,640
...was provided by the Cheng family.

309
00:17:13,839 --> 00:17:14,640
And another thing.

310
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:18,000
You've known this Zhuang Sheng all along.

311
00:17:18,359 --> 00:17:19,160
Right?

312
00:17:19,839 --> 00:17:21,200
How do you have his files?

313
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,400
Put the files down.

314
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:23,279
You.

315
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:24,720
Get out.

316
00:17:28,119 --> 00:17:29,279
It was you all along.

317
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,680
Why did you frame me?

318
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:33,440
If someone is stupid,

319
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:34,599
they should just lay low.

320
00:17:34,599 --> 00:17:36,400
Then they can live in peace.

321
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:37,440
But look at you.

322
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,039
Not only are you stupid,

323
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:40,839
you also try to ruin others.

324
00:17:41,319 --> 00:17:42,200
Zhuang Sheng

325
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:44,759
was a lesson for you and Auntie Ying.

326
00:17:44,839 --> 00:17:47,240
Just bait to make you two dogs fight.

327
00:17:48,039 --> 00:17:49,279
You scullery maid!

328
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:51,559
Did you think you could still

329
00:17:51,559 --> 00:17:52,680
bully me like before?

330
00:17:53,599 --> 00:17:54,240
What you just said,

331
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:55,599
I've already recorded it.

332
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:58,000
Director Cheng of Gufeng Group,

333
00:17:58,599 --> 00:18:01,279
former Xie Group chairman's trophy wife,

334
00:18:01,279 --> 00:18:02,640
loves being a thief.

335
00:18:03,359 --> 00:18:05,039
If this gets out...

336
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:06,839
Lin Wanmei!

337
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:08,960
Don't think just because you're pregnant

338
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:10,480
you can strut around in the Cheng family.

339
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:12,200
I'm telling you,

340
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:13,759
I won't let you off!

341
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:24,799
No way.

342
00:18:25,359 --> 00:18:26,160
Why not?

343
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:27,480
I need this money right now.

344
00:18:27,799 --> 00:18:28,680
Director Cheng,

345
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:31,960
the funds diverted last time aren't back.

346
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:32,920
Right now,

347
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:37,480
if I move these funds out,

348
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,920
I'll use it for a month,

349
00:18:39,119 --> 00:18:40,839
and the deficit will be covered.

350
00:18:40,839 --> 00:18:42,319
Why can't I get this through to you?

351
00:18:42,319 --> 00:18:43,119
Director Cheng,

352
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:44,960
it's not that I don't trust you,

353
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:47,440
but you say this every time.

354
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:48,200
And as a result...

355
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:51,759
Our deficit just keeps getting bigger!

356
00:18:56,279 --> 00:18:57,160
Zhao,

357
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:00,440
you've been with the company for so long.

358
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:01,759
I've treated you well, haven't I?

359
00:19:03,119 --> 00:19:05,119
So, are you on my side?

360
00:19:05,319 --> 00:19:06,480
Of course I am.

361
00:19:07,440 --> 00:19:09,160
It's just a small favor.

362
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:10,680
Are you going to help me or not?

363
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:12,680
I really can't this time.

364
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:15,119
If you're really in urgent need of money,

365
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:16,720
why don't you

366
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,039
ask Cheng An for help?

367
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:19,559
He definitely has the means.

368
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,519
Is he the boss, or am I?

369
00:19:24,039 --> 00:19:24,759
Get lost!

370
00:19:24,799 --> 00:19:25,720
Get the hell out of here!

371
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:27,240
Useless trash!

372
00:19:33,079 --> 00:19:34,240
Accountant Zhao.

373
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:35,640
What are you doing here?

374
00:19:35,839 --> 00:19:36,640
I...

375
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:37,880
was just reporting on my work.

376
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:41,000
Come on.

377
00:19:41,119 --> 00:19:42,480
Have afternoon tea with me.

378
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:55,680
Good afternoon, Little Uncle.

379
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:01,799
What a coincidence.

380
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:09,960
Making some money?

381
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:11,039
Yeah.

382
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:14,359
Since I can't join and get paid,

383
00:20:14,359 --> 00:20:15,640
can't I make a little money on my own?

384
00:20:18,759 --> 00:20:20,279
If you want to work,

385
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:22,279
I can recommend you to other companies.

386
00:20:23,599 --> 00:20:25,400
But I only want to join Gufeng Group.

387
00:20:26,319 --> 00:20:28,559
Gufeng Group has the people I want to see.

388
00:20:31,799 --> 00:20:32,839
Little Uncle,

389
00:20:33,319 --> 00:20:34,319
you're so nice.

390
00:20:34,720 --> 00:20:36,079
Why don't you help me out?

391
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:40,319
You're asking for too much.

392
00:20:40,799 --> 00:20:41,960
I can't do that.

393
00:20:47,440 --> 00:20:49,240
I'll find my own way then, Little Uncle.

394
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:10,000
I still need to warn you.

395
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:12,000
Gufeng Group isn't a clean place.

396
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:14,559
If you want a job,

397
00:21:14,720 --> 00:21:16,519
you can totally find one you like more,

398
00:21:17,279 --> 00:21:18,519
an easier job.

399
00:21:22,079 --> 00:21:23,039
Are you done?

400
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:24,799
Then thank you, Little Uncle.

401
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:26,799
But as for me,

402
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,319
I'm not exactly a clean person either.

403
00:21:28,519 --> 00:21:30,279
I just like diving into the trash.

404
00:21:30,599 --> 00:21:32,079
Or I wouldn't be in the Cheng family.

405
00:21:32,480 --> 00:21:33,400
Don't you agree?

406
00:21:42,039 --> 00:21:43,640
I oppose Sang Luo joining Gufeng Group.

407
00:21:43,759 --> 00:21:44,920
Sit down.

408
00:21:44,960 --> 00:21:46,240
I'm still here.

409
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:47,559
Is it your turn to speak?

410
00:21:50,680 --> 00:21:51,519
Grandmother.

411
00:21:51,880 --> 00:21:53,839
Aunt probably thinks I'm too young,

412
00:21:53,960 --> 00:21:55,240
and worries I won't be able to handle it.

413
00:21:57,359 --> 00:21:58,680
But rest assured, Grandmother.

414
00:21:59,039 --> 00:22:00,920
I'll definitely do my best.

415
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:02,680
Cut the innocent act.

416
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:04,640
Can just anyone join Gufeng Group?

417
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:06,039
Look at yourself and see if you're worthy.

418
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:08,519
Aunt Lin.

419
00:22:09,039 --> 00:22:10,599
Our status in this house

420
00:22:10,599 --> 00:22:11,680
is the exact same.

421
00:22:13,359 --> 00:22:15,119
We're both isolated, helpless outsiders.

422
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:17,559
I agree Sang Luo can join Gufeng Group.

423
00:22:17,680 --> 00:22:18,519
Lin Wanmei!

424
00:22:19,079 --> 00:22:20,319
Have you lost your mind?

425
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:21,960
Her joining Gufeng Group...

426
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,319
what good does it do you?

427
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:26,119
We're all family.

428
00:22:26,200 --> 00:22:27,960
Why talk about benefits?

429
00:22:28,799 --> 00:22:30,440
Sang Luo is Brother Feng's child.

430
00:22:30,559 --> 00:22:32,319
We should all lend her a hand.

431
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:37,000
Enough.

432
00:22:37,559 --> 00:22:38,960
You, as her Aunt,

433
00:22:39,160 --> 00:22:40,880
are worse than an outsider

434
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:42,279
at treating our own family well.

435
00:22:44,640 --> 00:22:45,440
She

436
00:22:45,519 --> 00:22:47,519
is your own niece.

437
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:49,079
I make the decision.

438
00:22:49,559 --> 00:22:50,559
Let Luo Luo

439
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:52,119
work at Gufeng Group.

440
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:55,160
As for which department,

441
00:22:55,839 --> 00:22:57,319
just go to Ruolin's department.

442
00:22:58,000 --> 00:22:59,119
That way, Sang Luo

443
00:22:59,440 --> 00:23:01,519
can show her Aunt what she's capable of.

444
00:23:02,119 --> 00:23:02,920
Okay.

445
00:23:04,119 --> 00:23:05,680
I'll go to Aunt's department then.

446
00:23:06,279 --> 00:23:08,440
I'll make sure to impress Aunt.

447
00:23:17,960 --> 00:23:18,759
Lin Wanmei.

448
00:23:26,839 --> 00:23:29,599
Who knew the sophisticated President Lin...

449
00:23:29,839 --> 00:23:32,240
is actually a scullery maid at home?

450
00:23:32,640 --> 00:23:34,799
Why don't you use that thing in your belly

451
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:36,359
to throw your weight around anymore?

452
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:39,759
Have you heard this story?

453
00:23:40,319 --> 00:23:42,640
If someone lives on the edge of a knife,

454
00:23:42,759 --> 00:23:44,960
and one day they stop obeying,

455
00:23:44,960 --> 00:23:46,240
you have to find a knife

456
00:23:46,240 --> 00:23:48,000
to intimidate them once again.

457
00:23:48,799 --> 00:23:50,279
Now I just want to know

458
00:23:51,440 --> 00:23:52,480
if Ye Xiaowei

459
00:23:53,359 --> 00:23:55,079
is still a useful knife.

460
00:23:56,920 --> 00:23:58,839
From your expression, I can tell

461
00:23:58,960 --> 00:24:01,079
this knife is still quite handy.

462
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:04,839
Don't forget,

463
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:06,319
in what happened to Ye Xiaowei,

464
00:24:06,319 --> 00:24:07,240
you played a part too.

465
00:24:09,240 --> 00:24:11,000
You've been in our family for so long.

466
00:24:11,599 --> 00:24:13,680
How do you still not know your place?

467
00:24:14,200 --> 00:24:15,640
If this gets out,

468
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:18,559
my mom will naturally protect me.

469
00:24:19,359 --> 00:24:20,559
But what about you?

470
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:23,000
After you give birth to this child,

471
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:26,400
you'll be kicked out of the house.

472
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:28,079
Lin Wanmei,

473
00:24:28,839 --> 00:24:30,480
I'm done wasting my breath on you.

474
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:33,359
Give me another million.

475
00:24:36,440 --> 00:24:38,240
Didn't I just give you a million?

476
00:24:38,640 --> 00:24:39,440
I don't have it.

477
00:24:39,519 --> 00:24:40,759
That's your problem.

478
00:24:41,200 --> 00:24:42,400
You need to remember,

479
00:24:42,640 --> 00:24:43,759
as long as you're in the Cheng family,

480
00:24:43,759 --> 00:24:44,960
and I have leverage over you,

481
00:24:44,960 --> 00:24:46,440
you must always

482
00:24:46,440 --> 00:24:47,160
respect me,

483
00:24:47,160 --> 00:24:48,000
fear me,

484
00:24:48,200 --> 00:24:49,240
and please me.

485
00:24:50,359 --> 00:24:51,160
Oh,

486
00:24:51,359 --> 00:24:52,160
right.

487
00:24:52,720 --> 00:24:55,039
I wouldn't mind letting the company see

488
00:24:55,799 --> 00:24:58,359
just how sophisticated President Lin truly is.

489
00:25:05,400 --> 00:25:07,680
Why get so angry, Auntie?

490
00:25:09,759 --> 00:25:11,039
As for partners,

491
00:25:11,039 --> 00:25:12,400
picking a stupid one

492
00:25:13,160 --> 00:25:15,079
is just asking for trouble.

493
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,440
A partnership

494
00:25:17,440 --> 00:25:19,000
isn't about whether they're stupid,

495
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:21,039
but whether they're useful.

496
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:23,440
I am naturally more useful than Cheng Ruolin.

497
00:25:24,200 --> 00:25:26,640
I won't do stupid things to annoy you, Auntie.

498
00:25:27,960 --> 00:25:28,759
Speaking of which,

499
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:30,160
Aunt is quite pitiful.

500
00:25:30,519 --> 00:25:32,279
A love-starved woman like her...

501
00:25:32,839 --> 00:25:33,640
tell me,

502
00:25:34,039 --> 00:25:35,440
if there were a man

503
00:25:35,519 --> 00:25:36,960
who could give her some warmth,

504
00:25:37,839 --> 00:25:39,480
would she still have the extra energy

505
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:40,839
to provoke you, Auntie?

506
00:25:41,079 --> 00:25:41,880
After all,

507
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:44,039
to deal with a woman like Aunt,

508
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:46,440
a man is the best tool.

509
00:25:50,640 --> 00:25:51,960
Then what do you want?

510
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:58,759
What I want doesn't matter.

511
00:26:05,599 --> 00:26:07,200
What matters is keeping you happy, Auntie.

512
00:26:19,920 --> 00:26:20,599
Mr. Cheng's car.

513
00:26:20,599 --> 00:26:21,359
Who's that?

514
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:22,240
Yeah.

515
00:26:22,319 --> 00:26:23,640
Getting out of Mr. Cheng's car.

516
00:26:25,599 --> 00:26:27,160
Thanks for dropping me off, Little Uncle.

517
00:26:53,359 --> 00:26:54,160
Ms. Lin is here.

518
00:26:54,240 --> 00:26:55,000
Ms. Lin. Ms. Lin.

519
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:56,440
Let me introduce you all.

520
00:26:56,480 --> 00:26:58,200
This is our new employee,

521
00:26:58,279 --> 00:26:59,079
Sang Luo.

522
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:07,039
Hello, everyone.

523
00:27:07,319 --> 00:27:08,599
My name is Ye Xiaowei.

524
00:27:08,920 --> 00:27:10,720
I'm very happy that starting today,

525
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:12,599
I can be colleagues with you all.

526
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:15,319
In the future, if you have any

527
00:27:15,359 --> 00:27:16,799
dirty or tiring work,

528
00:27:17,119 --> 00:27:18,559
or need packages picked up,

529
00:27:18,559 --> 00:27:20,039
you can leave it all to me.

530
00:27:22,759 --> 00:27:23,880
It's been three years.

531
00:27:24,440 --> 00:27:25,319
I'm back.

532
00:27:25,400 --> 00:27:26,119
Hello, everyone.

533
00:27:26,119 --> 00:27:27,039
My name is Sang Luo.

534
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:28,480
It's nice to meet you.

535
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:30,240
I look forward to working with you.

536
00:27:34,319 --> 00:27:35,440
Then take a look around to get familiar.

537
00:27:35,440 --> 00:27:36,160
I'll get back to work first.

538
00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:36,799
Okay.

539
00:27:37,079 --> 00:27:37,519
Xiaoxiao,

540
00:27:37,559 --> 00:27:38,160
show her around.

541
00:27:40,799 --> 00:27:41,480
Let's go.

542
00:27:41,480 --> 00:27:42,279
Take a look here.

543
00:27:44,519 --> 00:27:46,000
Okay, this looks about right.

544
00:27:49,839 --> 00:27:51,440
Your outfit is so pretty.

545
00:27:51,480 --> 00:27:52,480
This morning,

546
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:54,000
Mr. An dropped you off, didn't he?

547
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:55,480
The whole company is talking about it.

548
00:27:55,480 --> 00:27:56,200
Why?

549
00:27:56,200 --> 00:27:58,000
Are you two really close?

550
00:27:59,720 --> 00:28:01,079
Do you think I should tell the boss

551
00:28:01,079 --> 00:28:02,880
to move this Ye Xiaowei somewhere else?

552
00:28:03,440 --> 00:28:05,200
I find her so annoying.

553
00:28:05,200 --> 00:28:06,799
Just look at her outfit today.

554
00:28:06,880 --> 00:28:08,240
Her sweater is pilling.

555
00:28:09,319 --> 00:28:10,440
It's a disaster.

556
00:28:15,000 --> 00:28:15,920
They're insulting you,

557
00:28:16,119 --> 00:28:17,000
and you aren't saying anything?

558
00:28:18,319 --> 00:28:19,119
Are you mute?

559
00:28:22,319 --> 00:28:24,039
Mr. An is my Little Uncle.

560
00:28:25,559 --> 00:28:26,880
So naturally, he'd drop me off.

561
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:28,559
As for this outfit...

562
00:28:28,559 --> 00:28:29,599
it's authentic.

563
00:28:29,839 --> 00:28:30,880
Of course it looks good.

564
00:28:31,799 --> 00:28:33,079
Unlike yours.

565
00:28:33,480 --> 00:28:34,279
It's a knockoff, isn't it?

566
00:28:35,480 --> 00:28:37,480
What's so great about the Cheng family?

567
00:28:37,519 --> 00:28:39,319
Nothing particularly great.

568
00:28:40,039 --> 00:28:41,480
But you can't afford to mess with them.

569
00:28:49,680 --> 00:28:51,160
She's also part of the Cheng family.

570
00:28:51,279 --> 00:28:52,480
And she's your older brother's daughter.

571
00:28:52,839 --> 00:28:55,680
Shouldn't you be happy I let her join the company?

572
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:58,039
Because I don't believe you'd be that kind.

573
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:01,680
Tell me.

574
00:29:02,240 --> 00:29:03,200
What benefits did she give you?

575
00:29:05,880 --> 00:29:06,960
So Mr. An

576
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:09,319
doesn't trust his own little niece.

577
00:29:15,359 --> 00:29:17,200
Sang Luo's origins are a bit fishy.

578
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:18,720
I doubt Ms. Lin hasn't suspected anything.

579
00:29:19,319 --> 00:29:20,759
If she is my older brother's daughter,

580
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:22,279
I will definitely protect her

581
00:29:22,960 --> 00:29:24,839
and keep her out of Gufeng Group's mess.

582
00:29:25,480 --> 00:29:26,920
But if she isn't,

583
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:29,440
I will naturally protect Gufeng Group too,

584
00:29:30,119 --> 00:29:31,880
and stop external factors from ruining it.

585
00:29:32,240 --> 00:29:33,319
Then, Mr. An,

586
00:29:33,319 --> 00:29:34,759
which outcome are you hoping for?

587
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:37,000
What outcome I hope for doesn't matter.

588
00:29:37,279 --> 00:29:38,200
But you, on the other hand...

589
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:39,839
taking such good care of someone

590
00:29:39,839 --> 00:29:42,119
who will fight your baby for the fortune.

591
00:29:42,240 --> 00:29:43,400
I find that very strange.

592
00:29:43,759 --> 00:29:44,920
What's so strange about it?

593
00:29:46,039 --> 00:29:47,480
Your older brother is gone.

594
00:29:47,519 --> 00:29:48,960
As his wife,

595
00:29:49,119 --> 00:29:52,000
shouldn't I care for his child for him?

596
00:29:57,359 --> 00:29:59,680
Playing the good wife and mother now?

597
00:30:00,799 --> 00:30:02,240
Others might not know your true colors,

598
00:30:02,799 --> 00:30:04,240
but do you think I don't?

599
00:30:07,279 --> 00:30:09,400
Mr. An, I think I need to remind you.

600
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:12,440
Sang Luo has finished her onboarding.

601
00:30:12,440 --> 00:30:14,440
She's now a formal employee of the group.

602
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:16,039
If you want her to leave,

603
00:30:16,039 --> 00:30:17,480
your only option is to fire her.

604
00:30:17,480 --> 00:30:20,200
And to fire her, you'd need a valid reason.

605
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:21,279
Otherwise,

606
00:30:21,839 --> 00:30:24,240
it'll be hard to explain to the old lady.

607
00:30:35,480 --> 00:30:36,279
What's wrong?

608
00:30:36,279 --> 00:30:37,079
Director Cheng.

609
00:30:37,240 --> 00:30:38,400
Go to the storage room,

610
00:30:38,440 --> 00:30:40,640
and get all the purchasing records

611
00:30:40,720 --> 00:30:42,079
from the past three years sorted out.

612
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:44,000
What's so funny,

613
00:30:44,440 --> 00:30:45,880
Miss Sang Luo?

614
00:30:46,400 --> 00:30:48,640
Using your status in the Cheng family

615
00:30:48,960 --> 00:30:51,240
to avoid doing normal work?

616
00:30:52,720 --> 00:30:53,920
Lead the way, Director Cheng.

617
00:30:54,640 --> 00:30:56,000
Where is the storage room?

618
00:30:56,319 --> 00:30:57,440
You really are stupid.

619
00:31:05,519 --> 00:31:07,000
Sort all these out for me.

620
00:31:07,119 --> 00:31:08,400
Give them to me before you clock out.

621
00:31:09,319 --> 00:31:10,279
Yes, Director Cheng.

622
00:31:11,640 --> 00:31:12,440
Director Cheng,

623
00:31:12,880 --> 00:31:15,200
this bidding document you just gave me...

624
00:31:15,200 --> 00:31:16,200
I don't quite understand it.

625
00:31:16,200 --> 00:31:17,480
What does this mean?

626
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:24,799
Sang Luo!

627
00:31:25,079 --> 00:31:26,200
Open the door!

628
00:31:26,279 --> 00:31:27,279
Open the door right now!

629
00:31:27,279 --> 00:31:28,480
How can you be so vicious?!

630
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:31,079
How else could I work with you if I wasn't?

631
00:31:32,119 --> 00:31:33,759
Enjoy your stay in there.

632
00:31:33,759 --> 00:31:34,920
I figure it'll be a while

633
00:31:34,920 --> 00:31:36,519
before I find anyone to rescue you.

634
00:31:37,079 --> 00:31:38,200
If you get hungry,

635
00:31:38,319 --> 00:31:39,240
just read the files.

636
00:31:39,240 --> 00:31:40,119
Consider it food for thought.

637
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:56,279
Is this syrup really priced this high?

638
00:32:06,200 --> 00:32:08,599
If I bring this price down,

639
00:32:10,279 --> 00:32:11,519
wouldn't that cover the shortfall?

640
00:32:12,319 --> 00:32:13,279
Let's go across the street.

641
00:32:13,279 --> 00:32:13,960
Let's go, let's go.

642
00:32:14,680 --> 00:32:15,440
All right.

643
00:32:16,359 --> 00:32:17,519
Want to grab a bite together?

644
00:32:17,759 --> 00:32:18,519
No, I'm good.

645
00:32:18,519 --> 00:32:19,440
You guys go ahead.

646
00:32:19,480 --> 00:32:20,440
Oh, okay.

647
00:32:32,960 --> 00:32:33,759
How is it?

648
00:32:35,079 --> 00:32:35,880
The food at Gufeng Group,

649
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:37,680
is it not as good as you imagined?

650
00:32:37,720 --> 00:32:38,799
I just got here.

651
00:32:39,240 --> 00:32:40,240
Whether the food is good

652
00:32:40,240 --> 00:32:41,440
or bad,

653
00:32:41,440 --> 00:32:43,039
I still have to eat it.

654
00:32:44,920 --> 00:32:46,000
There was a girl once

655
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:47,039
who sat in this exact seat,

656
00:32:47,039 --> 00:32:48,440
saying the exact same things as you.

657
00:32:54,400 --> 00:32:55,920
But listen to me carefully.

658
00:32:56,440 --> 00:32:58,880
Your petty tricks at home didn't matter.

659
00:32:59,519 --> 00:33:00,720
Now that you're in the Group,

660
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:03,400
if you still dare to make waves,

661
00:33:03,640 --> 00:33:04,920
I won't let you off.
